c+c+c', on_hotkey)\n```\n\n**手机端处理:**\n```java\n// Android部分代码\npublic class TranslationService {\n    private MLTranslator translator;\n    \n    public void initHMSC"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":6727,"output":687,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7414,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771637355274}}
