{"type":"message","id":"37cb46bf","parentId":"951f3f76","timestamp":"2026-02-21T01:50:02.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"太好了！您已经通过USB连接手机，我可以直接帮您操作手机端的安装。让我为您完成手机端的完整配置：\n\n## 📱 手机端自动化安装步骤\n\n### 1. 首先检查USB连接状态\n```bash\nadb devices\n```\n\n### 2. 安装Termux应用\n```bash\n# 通过USB安装Termux\nadb install termux.apk\n\n# 或者如果已安装，确保有安装权限\nadb shell pm grant com.termux android.permission.INSTALL_PACKAGES\n```\n\n### 3. 推送必要文件到手机\n```bash\n# 创建手机上的项目目录\nadb shell mkdir -p /sdcard/translation-project\n\n# 推送客户端程序\nadb push phone_client.py /sdcard/translation-project/\n\n# 推送安装脚本\nadb push setup_instructions.md /sdcard/translation-project/\n```\n\n### 4. 在Termux中执行安装命令\n```bash\n# 启动Termux并执行安装\nadb shell am start -n com.termux/.app.TermuxActivity\n\n# 通过USB执行Termux命令\nadb shell input text \"pkg.update.&&.pkg.upgrade\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\nadb shell input text \"pkg.install.python.python-pip.termux-api\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\nadb shell input text \"cd./sdcard/translation-project\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\nadb shell input text \"pip.install.requests\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n```\n\n### 5. 设置Termux权限\n```bash\n# 授予Termux存储权限\nadb shell am start -a android.settings.APPLICATION_DETAILS_SETTINGS -d package:com.termux\n\n# 允许后台运行\nadb shell settings put global background_activity_starts_enabled 1\n```\n\n### 6. 测试通知功能\n```bash\n# 测试Termux通知\nadb shell input text \"termux-notification.-t.'测试成功'.-c.'手机端配置完成'\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n```\n\n## 🔧 电脑端同时设置\n\n在另一个终端中，启动电脑服务：\n```bash\n# 安装电脑端依赖\npython install_deps.py\n\n# 启动翻译服务\npython translation_server.py\n```\n\n服务启动后会显示类似：\n```\n📱 手机连接IP: 192.168.1.100\n🔌 端口: 8888\n```\n\n## 📲 最后在手机Termux中运行\n\n```bash\n# 进入项目目录\ncd /sdcard/translation-project\n\n# 运行客户端\npython phone_client.py\n\n# 输入电脑的IP地址（如192.168.1.100）\n```\n\n这样手机和电脑就通过USB和WiFi连接起来了！需要我开始执行这些步骤吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":15321,"output":630,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15951,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771638567536}}
