{"type":"message","id":"a7c4c9b7","parentId":"46c0d7c0","timestamp":"2026-02-21T01:57:24.534Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"      好的！我看到手机显示需要安装 `android-tools`，这通常是需要 ADB 工具。让我为您处理：\n\n## 🔧 首先在手机上安装必要工具\n\n```bash\n# 在Termux中安装android-tools\npkg install android-tools\n```\n\n## 📱 检查USB调试状态\n\n让我先检查手机的USB调试是否已开启：\n\n```bash\n# 检查ADB连接\nadb devices\n\n# 如果设备未授权，需要开启USB调试\nadb shell settings put global adb_enabled 1\n```\n\n## 🚀 开始自动化安装\n\n### 1. 推送文件到手机\n```bash\n# 推送客户端文件\nadb push phone_client.py /sdcard/\n\n# 检查文件是否推送成功\nadb shell ls -la /sdcard/phone_client.py\n```\n\n### 2. 在Termux中安装依赖\n```bash\n# 通过ADB在Termux中执行命令\nadb shell input text \"pkg.update.&&.pkg.upgrade\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\nsleep 5\n\nadb shell input text \"pkg.install.python.python-pip.termux-api.android-tools\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\nsleep 10\n```\n\n### 3. 设置项目目录\n```bash\n# 在Termux中创建项目目录\nadb shell input text \"mkdir.-p.~/translation-project\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\nadb shell input text \"cp./sdcard/phone_client.py.~/translation-project/\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n```\n\n### 4. 安装Python依赖\n```bash\nadb shell input text \"cd.~/translation-project\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\nadb shell input text \"pip.install.requests\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n```\n\n### 5. 测试安装\n```bash\n# 测试Python是否正常工作\nadb shell input text \"python.--version\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\n# 测试termux-api\nadb shell input text \"termux-notification.-t.'安装成功'.-c.'手机端准备就绪'\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n```\n\n## 💻 同时启动电脑端服务\n\n在电脑上打开新的终端窗口：\n```bash\n# 安装电脑端依赖\npip install keyboard pyautogui pyperclip Pillow\n\n# 启动翻译服务\npython translation_server.py\n```\n\n服务启动后会显示电脑的IP地址，比如：`192.168.1.100`\n\n## 📲 最后在手机Termux中连接\n\n```bash\n# 运行客户端并输入电脑IP\nadb shell input text \"cd.~/translation-project.&&.python.phone_client.py\"\nadb shell input keyevent KEYCODE_ENTER\n\n# 等待输入IP地址\necho \"请查看电脑上显示的IP地址，然后在手机Termux中输入\"\n```\n\n现在手机端应该已经准备就绪！让我检查一下安装状态：\n\n```bash\n# 检查手机端安装情况\nadb shell ls -la ~/translation-project/\nadb shell which python\nadb shell which termux-notification\n```\n\n请告诉我电脑端服务启动后显示的IP地址，我帮您在手机端输入连接。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":16038,"output":708,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16746,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771639007582}}
