{"type":"message","id":"49daea0f","parentId":"4fb04f02","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:14:24.292Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"     \n\n看起来Termux中还没有创建项目目录。让我帮您一步步设置：\n\n## 📱 **在手机Termux中执行以下命令：**\n\n### 1. 首先创建项目目录\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/translation-project\n```\n\n### 2. 检查sdcard中的文件\n```bash\nls -la /sdcard/phone_client.py\n```\n\n### 3. 如果文件存在，复制到项目目录\n```bash\ncp /sdcard/phone_client.py ~/translation-project/\n```\n\n### 4. 如果文件不存在，重新下载\n```bash\ncd ~/translation-project\nwget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/your-repo/translation-project/main/phone_client.py\n```\n\n或者手动创建文件：\n```bash\nnano phone_client.py\n```\n(然后粘贴我之前提供的代码内容)\n\n### 5. 安装必要的Python包\n```bash\npip install requests\n```\n\n### 6. 运行客户端\n```bash\ncd ~/translation-project\npython phone_client.py\n```\n\n### 7. 输入电脑IP地址\n```\n192.168.1.3\n```\n\n## 💻 **同时确保电脑端正在运行**\n\n在电脑上运行：\n```bash\npython translation_server.py\n```\n\n## 🔧 **如果遇到权限问题**\n```bash\n# 授予Termux存储权限\ntermux-setup-storage\n\n# 检查文件权限\nchmod +x ~/translation-project/phone_client.py\n```\n\n请告诉我您执行到哪一步了，或者遇到了什么具体问题？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":18020,"output":334,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18354,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771640042160}}
