{"type":"message","id":"2bd26ace","parentId":"39260f9e","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:16:44.005Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          \n\n您输入的命令有误，应该是 `mkdir` 而不是 `mk dir`。让我为您提供正确的命令：\n\n## 📱 **在Termux中执行正确的命令：**\n\n### 1. 创建项目目录\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/translation-project\n```\n\n### 2. 进入目录\n```bash\ncd ~/translation-project\n```\n\n### 3. 创建手机客户端文件\n```bash\nnano phone_client.py\n```\n\n然后按 `Ctrl+V` 粘贴以下代码（我之前提供的完整代码），然后按：\n- `Ctrl+O` 保存\n- `Enter` 确认文件名\n- `Ctrl+X` 退出\n\n### 4. 安装Python依赖\n```bash\npip install requests\n```\n\n### 5. 运行客户端\n```bash\npython phone_client.py\n```\n\n### 6. 输入电脑IP地址\n```\n192.168.1.3\n```\n\n## 💻 **电脑端确保正在运行**\n```bash\npython translation_server.py\n```\n\n请一步一步执行，如果遇到任何错误，请告诉我具体的错误信息！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":18520,"output":233,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18753,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771640188509}}
