{"type":"message","id":"520b1745","parentId":"b6c42e7e","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:36:59.165Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到您在nano编辑器中遇到了保存界面。让我告诉您如何操作：\n\n## 📱 **在nano保存界面的操作方法：**\n\n### 当前界面显示：\n```\nFile Name to Write: phone_client.py\n^G Help   M-D DOS Format   M-A Append   M-B Backup File\n^C Cancel M-M Mac Format   M-P Prepend  ^T Browse\n```\n\n### 正确的操作步骤：\n\n1. **您会看到光标在 `phone_client.py` 文件名后面闪烁**\n2. **直接按 `Enter` 键**（回车键）确认保存\n3. **然后按 `Ctrl+X`** 退出nano编辑器\n\n### 如果文件名不对：\n- 如果文件名不是 `phone_client.py`，请用退格键删除，然后输入正确的文件名\n- 输入完成后按 `Enter` 确认\n\n### 快捷键说明：\n- **^G Help** = Ctrl+G 帮助\n- **^C Cancel** = Ctrl+C 取消\n- **^T Browse** = Ctrl+T 浏览文件\n- **直接按 Enter** = 确认保存\n\n## 🎯 **请操作：**\n1. **确认文件名是 `phone_client.py`**\n2. **按 `Enter` 键**（回车键）\n3. **按 `Ctrl+X`** 退出\n\n这样文件就保存成功了！然后您可以继续运行：\n```bash\npython phone_client.py\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":23437,"output":301,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23738,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771641396343}}
