{"type":"message","id":"22c547cf","parentId":"6aee336a","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:50:43.777Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"     \n\n这个问题很常见！让我帮您排查：\n\n## 🔍 **可能的原因和解决方案：**\n\n### 1. **键盘监听权限问题**\nWindows可能需要管理员权限来监听全局快捷键：\n\n**以管理员身份运行：**\n```bash\n# 在PowerShell中以管理员身份运行\nStart-Process powershell -Verb RunAs -ArgumentList \"cd C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace; python translation_server.py\"\n```\n\n### 2. **键盘库兼容性问题**\n让我们测试键盘监听：\n\n**测试键盘监听：**\n```bash\npython -c \"import keyboard; keyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+c+c+c', lambda: print('Hotkey worked!')); input('Press Enter to exit...')\"\n```\n\n### 3. **替代方案：使用其他快捷键库**\n如果keyboard库有问题，我们可以用其他方式：\n\n**方案A：使用pyinput**\n```bash\npip install pyinput\n```\n\n**方案B：使用更简单的快捷键**\n修改为单次组合键：\n```bash\n# 修改为 Ctrl+Alt+T\nkeyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+alt+t', self.trigger_translation)\n```\n\n## 🛠️ **立即解决方案：**\n\n### 1. **首先检查键盘监听**\n让我创建一个测试程序："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_55fcd20b75734edf83ba84f4","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"test_keyboard.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\nimport keyboard\nimport time\n\ndef test_hotkey():\n    print(\"🔥 Hotkey triggered!\")\n\n# 测试不同的快捷键组合\nprint(\"Testing keyboard shortcuts...\")\nprint(\"1. Press Ctrl+Alt+T\")\nprint(\"2. Press Ctrl+C+C+C\")\nprint(\"3. Press Ctrl+Shift+T\")\n\nkeyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+alt+t', test_hotkey)\nkeyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+c+c+c', test_hotkey) \nkeyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+shift+t', test_hotkey)\n\nprint(\"Listening for hotkeys... Press Esc to exit\")\nkeyboard.wait('esc')"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":31939,"output":459,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32398,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771642212438}}
