{"type":"message","id":"55b8a956","parentId":"e1fd2eaa","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:55:49.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"      明白了！您已经用管理员权限运行了服务，但快捷键仍然不工作。这说明是 `keyboard` 库在您的系统上有兼容性问题。\n\n让我为您提供几种替代方案：\n\n## 🎯 **替代方案（推荐）：**\n\n### 方案1：使用剪贴板监听（最可靠）\n```python\nimport pyperclip\nimport time\nimport threading\n\nclass ClipboardMonitor:\n    def __init__(self, callback):\n        self.callback = callback\n        self.last_text = \"\"\n        self.running = True\n        \n    def start_monitoring(self):\n        def monitor():\n            while self.running:\n                try:\n                    current_text = pyperclip.paste()\n                    if current_text and current_text != self.last_text:\n                        self.callback(current_text)\n                        self.last_text = current_text\n                    time.sleep(0.5)\n                except:\n                    time.sleep(1)\n        \n        thread = threading.Thread(target=monitor)\n        thread.daemon = True\n        thread.start()\n```\n\n### 方案2：使用全局热键（替代库）\n```python\n# 安装：pip install pynput\nfrom pynput import keyboard\n\ndef on_activate():\n    print(\"Hotkey pressed!\")\n    \nwith keyboard.GlobalHotKeys({\n    '<ctrl>+<alt>+t': on_activate}) as h:\n    h.join()\n```\n\n### 方案3：GUI按钮触发\n```python\nimport tkinter as tk\n\ndef create_gui():\n    root = tk.Tk()\n    root.title(\"翻译触发器\")\n    \n    def trigger_translation():\n        print(\"手动触发翻译\")\n        # 您的翻译逻辑\n        \n    btn = tk.Button(root, text=\"翻译选中文本\", command=trigger_translation)\n    btn.pack(padx=20, pady=20)\n    \n    root.mainloop()\n```\n\n## 🚀 **立即实施方案1（推荐）：**\n\n让我修改您的 `translation_server.py` 来使用剪贴板监听："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a62f19766e3e4e9ba55092d6","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"translation_server.py","oldText":"    def setup_hotkey(self):\n        \"\"\"设置快捷键\"\"\"\n        # 注册Ctrl+连续三次C快捷键\n        keyboard.add_hotkey('ctrl+c+c+c', self.trigg