{"type":"message","id":"5cac9869","parentId":"ba2f0410","timestamp":"2026-02-21T02:59:22.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    这个版本的工作原理：\n1. **自动监听剪贴板** - 每秒检查一次\n2. **复制文本即触发** - 复制任何文本都会自动发送到手机\n3. **无需快捷键** - 彻底避免键盘监听问题\n\n## 🎯 **使用方法：**\n1. 在电脑上选中文本\n2. 按 `Ctrl+C` 复制\n3. 自动触发翻译\n\n## 📱 **手机端操作：**\n保持 `python phone_client.py` 运行，输入IP `192.168.1.3`\n\n这样应该能正常工作了！复制文本就能自动翻译。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":37003,"output":132,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37135,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771642748075}}
