{"type":"message","id":"30a6f0db","parentId":"ccbf5b81","timestamp":"2026-02-21T03:23:57.518Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到之前的测试程序被终止了。现在让我专注于主要的服务。\n\n从之前的netstat输出，我看到连接确实已经建立（ESTABLISHED状态），但数据传输可能有问题。\n\n## 🎯 **让我们做一个简单的测试：**\n\n### 1. **首先在电脑上创建一个简单的测试服务器**\n```bash\npython -c \\\"import socket; s=socket.socket(); s.bind(('0.0.0.0',8888)); s.listen(1); print('Test server ready'); conn,addr=s.accept(); print(f'Connected: {addr}'); conn.send(b'Hello from PC!'); print('Message sent')\\\"\n```\n\n### 2. **然后在手机Termux中测试连接**\n```bash\npython -c \\\"import socket; s=socket.socket(); s.connect(('192.168.1.3',8888)); data=s.recv(1024); print(f'Received: {data.decode()}')\\\"\n```\n\n这样我们可以先排除网络连接的基本问题。\n\n## 🔧 **或者让我们回到原始方法：**\n\n既然快捷键有问题，让我提供一个更简单的替代方案：\n\n### **方案：使用HTTP服务器代替TCP**\n```python\n# 简单的HTTP服务器\nfrom http.server import HTTPServer, BaseHTTPRequestHandler\nimport json\n\nclass RequestHandler(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def do_POST(self):\n        content_length = int(self.headers['Content-Length'])\n        post_data = self.rfile.read(content_length)\n        data = json.loads(post_data.decode())\n        print(f\"Received: {data}\")\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.end_headers()\n\nhttpd = HTTPServer(('0.0.0.0', 8888), RequestHandler)\nprint(\"HTTP server started\")\nhttpd.serve_forever()\n```\n\n您希望我尝试哪种调试方法？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":39599,"output":385,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39984,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771644153690}}
