{"type":"message","id":"ef77e4d4","parentId":"a702f75b","timestamp":"2026-02-21T03:27:44.992Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    我看到您在手机Termux中显示\"已连接到电脑\"，这很好！但是测试命令有语法错误。\n\n让我提供正确的测试命令：\n\n## 🎯 **在电脑PowerShell中运行：**\n```bash\npython -c \"import socket; s=socket.socket(); s.bind(('0.0.0.0',8888)); s.listen(1); print('Test server ready'); conn,addr=s.accept(); print(f'Connected: {addr}'); conn.send(b'Hello from PC!'); print('Message sent')\"\n```\n\n## 📱 **在手机Termux中运行：**\n```bash\npython -c \"import socket; s=socket.socket(); s.connect(('192.168.1.3',8888)); data=s.recv(1024); print(f'Received: {data.decode()}')\"\n```\n\n## 🔍 **或者让我们检查当前服务的状态：**\n让我查看当前运行的服务进程：\n```bash\ntasklist | findstr python\n```\n\n然后我们可以重启调试版本的服务。\n\n您想要先进行简单的socket测试，还是继续调试当前的服务？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":40160,"output":233,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40393,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771644298341}}
