{"type":"message","id":"e6aa607f","parentId":"70419294","timestamp":"2026-02-21T03:41:51.522Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                      现在服务已经重新启动。请在手机Termux中：\n\n1. **先退出当前客户端**（按Ctrl+C）\n2. **重新运行客户端**：\n   ```bash\n   cd ~/translation-project\n   python phone_client.py\n   ```\n3. **输入IP地址**：`192.168.1.3`\n\n4. **等待显示\"已连接到电脑\"**\n\n5. **然后在电脑上复制一些文本**（按Ctrl+C）\n\n这样我们就能看到调试信息了。服务已经在运行并等待连接！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":40925,"output":114,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41039,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771645302214}}
