{"type":"message","id":"cbb70560","parentId":"84788baa","timestamp":"2026-02-21T03:44:12.005Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎉 **太棒了！连接成功了！**\n\n从输出可以看到：\n1. ✅ **连接成功**: 手机已连接到电脑\n2. 📥 **收到消息**: 收到了文本翻译请求\n3. 📝 **文本内容**: `_client.py` \n4. 🌍 **翻译结果**: 工作正常\n\n## ❗ **唯一的问题：**\n`termux-notification: not found` - 需要安装 termux-api\n\n## 📱 **在手机Termux中安装termux-api：**\n\n```bash\n# 安装termux-api包\npkg install termux-api\n\n# 同时安装termux-api应用\n# 在华为应用市场搜索\"Termux:API\"并安装\n```\n\n## 🔧 **临时解决方案：**\n在安装termux-api之前，我们可以修改代码使用其他通知方式：\n\n**修改 phone_client.py：**\n```python\ndef show_notification(self, title, content):\n    \"\"\"显示通知\"\"\"\n    try:\n        # 使用termux-notification命令显示通知\n        cmd = f\"termux-notification -t '{title}' -c '{content}'\"\n        subprocess.run(cmd, shell=True, check=True)\n        print(\"📲 通知已发送\")\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"❌ 发送通知失败: {e}\")\n        # 备用方案：直接打印到屏幕\n        print(f\"💡 {title}: {content}\")\n```\n\n## 🎯 **现在测试：**\n1. 在电脑上复制一些英文文本（如\"hello\"）\n2. 手机会收到并显示翻译结果\n\n**连接已经完全正常工作！** 只需要解决通知功能就可以了。\n\n您想要安装termux-api，还是我先修改代码使用备用通知方式？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":41240,"output":370,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41610,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771645384930}}
