{"type":"message","id":"8ff2833d","parentId":"327175d0","timestamp":"2026-02-21T04:13:46.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                     现在请重新运行手机客户端：\n\n1. **退出当前客户端**（Ctrl+C）\n2. **重新运行**：\n   ```bash\n   cd ~/translation-project\n   python phone_client.py\n   ```\n3. **输入IP**：`192.168.1.3`\n\n4. **测试翻译**：复制 \"python phone\"\n\n现在应该显示：\"Python 手机\" 而不是 \"[python phone]的翻译结果\"\n\n并且连接应该更稳定！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":46114,"output":101,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46215,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771647203167}}
