{"type":"message","id":"8a5c04df","parentId":"8adb8559","timestamp":"2026-02-21T05:40:30.792Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                            新的稳定版本专门解决了这些问题：\n\n## 🎯 **解决方案：**\n\n### 1. **自动重连机制**\n```python\ndef disconnect(self):\n    # 自动重连逻辑\n    self.reconnect_count += 1\n    if self.reconnect_count <= 3:\n        print(f\"🔄 尝试第 {self.reconnect_count} 次重连...\")\n        time.sleep(2)\n        if self.connect_to_server():\n            self.receive_data()\n```\n\n### 2. **心跳保持连接**\n```python\n# 客户端发送心跳\nheartbeat = json.dumps({\"type\": \"heartbeat\", \"time\": time.time()})\nself.socket.send(heartbeat.encode('utf-8'))\n\n# 服务端设置超时\nclient_socket.settimeout(300)  # 5分钟超时\n```\n\n### 3. **连接确认机制**\n```python\n# 收到消息后发送确认\nack_msg = json.dumps({\n    \"status\": \"ack\", \n    \"received_type\": message.get('type'),\n    \"timestamp\": time.time()\n})\nself.socket.send(ack_msg.encode('utf-8'))\n```\n\n## 🚀 **现在测试：**\n\n1. **在手机Termux中运行新客户端**：\n   ```bash\n   python stable_client.py\n   ```\n   输入IP：`192.168.1.3`\n\n2. **多次复制不同文本测试**：\n   - \"hello world\"\n   - \"python programming\" \n   - \"thank you very much\"\n\n3. **测试断线重连**：可以故意断开网络看看是否能自动重连\n\n这个版本应该能解决操作一次就断线和掉线的问题！请测试效果。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":50523,"output":364,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50887,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771652403749}}
