{"type":"message","id":"80a7f2cf","parentId":"2b8a8253","timestamp":"2026-02-21T05:54:05.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"      🎉 **太好了！您已经成功安装了 `translate-shell`！**\n\n这是一个非常强大的命令行翻译工具，现在手机可以直接执行翻译任务了！\n\n## 🚀 **现在可以使用真正的翻译功能了！**\n\n### **测试翻译工具：**\n```bash\n# 测试英文到中文翻译\ntrans -t zh \"hello\"\n\n# 测试句子翻译  \ntrans -t zh \"thank you very much\"\n\n# 测试技术词汇\ntrans -t zh \"python programming\"\n```\n\n### **修改手机客户端使用真实翻译：**\n让我修改客户端代码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_12f2ff073bd14f08b84a6eb3","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"stable_client.py","oldText":"    def improved_translation(self, text):\n        \"\"\"改进的翻译功能\"\"\"\n        # 常用词汇翻译词典\n        translation_dict = {\n            # 基础问候\n            \"hello\": \"你好\", \"hi\": \"你好\", \"hey\": \"嘿\",\n            \"good morning\": \"早上好\", \"good afternoon\": \"下午好\", \"good evening\": \"晚上好\",\n            \"thank you\": \"谢谢\", \"thanks\": \"谢谢\", \"please\": \"请\",\n            \"sorry\": \"对不起\", \"excuse me\": \"打扰一下\",\n            \n            # 技术词汇\n            \"python\": \"Python\", \"java\": \"Java\", \"javascript\": \"JavaScript\",\n            \"programming\": \"编程\", \"code\": \"代码\", \"algorithm\": \"算法\",\n            \"computer\": \"电脑\", \"phone\": \"手机\", \"mobile\": \"移动\",\n            \"translation\": \"翻译\", \"server\": \"服务器\", \"client\": \"客户端\",\n            \"network\": \"网络\", \"internet\": \"互联网\", \"data\": \"数据\",\n            \n            # 常见单词\n            \"world\": \"世界\", \"china\": \"中国\", \"english\": \"英语\", \"chinese\": \"中文\",\n            \"book\": \"书\", \"pen\": \"笔\", \"paper\": \"纸\", \"water\": \"水\",\n            \"food\": \"食物\", \"time\": \"时间\", \"day\": \"天\", \"night\": \"夜晚\",\n            \"work\": \"工作\", \"home\": \"家\", \"school\": \"学校\", \"student\": \"学生\",\n            \n            # 动词\n            \"run\": \"运行\", \"execute\": \"执行\", \"start\": \"开始\", \"stop\": \"停止\",\n            \"create\": \"创建\", \"delete\": \"删除\", \"update\": \"更新\", \"read\": \"读取\",\n            \"write\": \"写入\", \"send\": \"发送\", \"receive\": \"接收\", \"connect\": \"连接\"\n        }\n        \n        # 转换为小写并分割单词\n        text_lower = text.lower()\n        \n        # 先尝试完整匹配\n        if text_lower in translation_dict:\n            return translation_dict[text_lower]\n        \n        # 尝试分割单词翻译\n        words = text_lower.split()\n        translated_words = []\n        \n        for word in words:\n            if word in translation_dict:\n                translated_words.append(translation_dict[word])\n            else:\n                translated_words.append(word)\n        \n        return \" \".join(translated_words)","newText":"    def improved_translation(self, text):\n        \"\"\"使用translate-shell进行真实翻译\"\"\"\n        try:\n            # 使用translate-shell进行翻译\n            cmd = f\"trans -t zh '{text}'\"\n            result = subprocess.run(cmd, shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n            \n            if result.returncode == 0:\n                # 提取翻译结果\n                output = result.stdout\n                # 查找翻译结果行\n                lines = output.split('\\n')\n                for line in lines:\n                    if line.strip() and not line.startswith('[') and not '→' in line:\n                        return line.strip()\n                \n                # 如果没找到明确结果，返回原始输出\n                return output[:100]  # 限制长度\n            else:\n                print(f\"翻译命令错误: {result.stderr}\")\n                return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\"\n                \n        except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n            print(\"翻译超时\")\n            return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"翻译错误: {e}\")\n            return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":53242,"output":1029,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54271,"cost":{"input":0