{"type":"message","id":"9bc0afd5","parentId":"8b264444","timestamp":"2026-02-21T06:08:36.749Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                      我看到设备已连接但未授权。您需要在手机上：\n\n## 📱 **在手机上操作：**\n\n1. **开启USB调试授权**：\n   - 当弹出\"允许USB调试吗？\"的对话框时\n   - 选择\"始终允许从此计算机\"  \n   - 点击\"确定\"\n\n2. **或者重新插拔USB线**触发授权提示\n\n3. **检查开发者选项**：\n   - 确保USB调试已开启\n   - 确保\"仅充电\"模式下允许调试\n\n授权后再次运行：\n```bash\nadb devices\n```\n\n应该会显示 `device` 而不是 `unauthorized`。请完成授权操作！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":59417,"output":140,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771654106866}}
