{"type":"message","id":"80bb893e","parentId":"8a6f6381","timestamp":"2026-02-21T06:14:23.607Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          很好！Termux已经更新完成。现在让我指导您安装必要的工具：\n\n## 📱 **在Termux中安装必要工具：**\n\n### 1. **安装Android工具包**\n```bash\npkg install android-tools\n```\n\n### 2. **安装Termux API**\n```bash\npkg install termux-api\n```\n\n### 3. **安装翻译工具**\n```bash\npkg install translate-shell\n```\n\n### 4. **验证安装**\n```bash\n# 检查工具是否安装成功\nadb version\ntrans -version\ntermux-notification -h\n```\n\n## 🚀 **然后运行翻译客户端：**\n\n```bash\ncd ~/translation-project\npython phone_client.py\n```\n\n输入电脑IP地址：`192.168.1.3`\n\n## 🔧 **如果遇到权限问题：**\n```bash\n# 授予Termux必要的权限\ntermux-setup-storage\ntermux-microphone-record\n```\n\n请先安装这些工具，然后我们就可以测试整个翻译系统了！安装完成后请告诉我。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":60234,"output":222,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60456,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771654426492}}
