{"type":"message","id":"35a12a7d","parentId":"c8a72c29","timestamp":"2026-02-21T06:34:01.989Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        您说得对！让我明确一下需要复制的文件：\n\n## 📁 **需要复制的文件：**\n\n我已经通过ADB将修复后的 `phone_client.py` 推送到了手机的 `/sdcard/` 目录。\n\n### **在手机Termux中执行：**\n```bash\n# 1. 复制修复后的文件到项目目录\ncp /sdcard/phone_client.py ~/translation-project/\n\n# 2. 覆盖原有文件（确认覆盖）\n# 输入 y 确认\n\n# 3. 运行客户端\ncd ~/translation-project\npython phone_client.py\n```\n\n### **输入电脑IP地址：**\n```\n192.168.1.3\n```\n\n## 🔧 **修复的内容：**\n新的 `phone_client.py` 包含了：\n1. ✅ **真实翻译功能** - 使用 `translate-shell` 而不是模拟翻译\n2. ✅ **改进的错误处理** - 更好的错误提示\n3. ✅ **详细的调试信息** - 显示翻译命令的输出\n\n## 🎯 **如果还是不能翻译：**\n请运行这个测试命令来诊断问题：\n```bash\n# 测试translate-shell是否正常工作\npython -c \"import subprocess; result = subprocess.run('trans -t zh \\\"hello world\\\"', shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True); print('STDOUT:', repr(result.stdout)); print('STDERR:', repr(result.stderr)); print('Return code:', result.returncode)\"\n```\n\n请先复制文件并运行测试，这样我就能看到具体的问题了！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":64922,"output":327,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65249,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771655603266}}
