{"type":"message","id":"a85bd1d6","parentId":"f714524b","timestamp":"2026-02-21T06:54:16.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"您说得非常对！本地词典确实无法覆盖所有单词，翻译准确性也无法保证。\n\n让我为您提供几个更好的解决方案：\n\n## 🎯 **更好的解决方案：**\n\n### **方案1: 使用免费翻译API**\n```python\nimport requests\n\ndef translate_with_api(text):\n    \"\"\"使用免费翻译API\"\"\"\n    try:\n        # 使用Google翻译API（免费）\n        url = f\"https://translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single?client=gtx&sl=en&tl=zh&dt=t&q={requests.utils.quote(text)}\"\n        response = requests.get(url, timeout=10)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            data = response.json()\n            return data[0][0][0]  # 提取翻译结果\n        return f\"[API翻译失败] {text}\"\n    except:\n        return f\"[网络错误] {text}\"\n```\n\n### **方案2: 使用多个备用方案**\n```python\ndef smart_translation(text):\n    \"\"\"智能翻译：尝试多种方法\"\"\"\n    # 方法1: 本地词典（快速）\n    local_result = local_dict_translation(text)\n    if local_result != text:  # 如果有翻译结果\n        return local_result\n    \n    # 方法2: 翻译API（准确）\n    try:\n        api_result = translate_with_api(text)\n        return api_result\n    except:\n        pass\n    \n    # 方法3: 使用translate-shell（如果有网络）\n    try:\n        import subprocess\n        result = subprocess.run(f'trans -t zh \"{text}\"', \n                              shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=15)\n        if result.returncode == 0:\n            return result.stdout.split('\\n')[0]  # 取第一行\n    except:\n        pass\n    \n    return f\"[翻译] {text}\"\n```\n\n### **方案3: 缓存常用翻译**\n```python\n# 自动缓存已经成功翻译的结果\ntranslation_cache = {}\n\ndef cached_translation(text):\n    if text in translation_cache:\n        return translation_cache[text]\n    \n    # 尝试翻译并缓存\n    result = smart_translation(text)\n    translation_cache[text] = result\n    return result\n```\n\n## 🚀 **推荐方案1+3组合：**\n1. **先用本地词典**（快速）\n2. **失败则用API**（准确）  \n3. **缓存成功结果**（提高效率）\n\n您希望我实现哪种方案？我推荐**方案2**的智能翻译，兼顾速度和准确性！"}],"api":"openai-completions