{"type":"message","id":"deccb993","parentId":"a14d9246","timestamp":"2026-02-21T06:59:10.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          您测试确认了问题：**`translate-shell` 需要30秒以上才能响应**，这太慢了！\n\n您说得对，本地词典确实无法提供强大的翻译能力。让我为您提供几个实用的解决方案：\n\n## 🎯 **实用的解决方案：**\n\n### **方案1: 使用在线翻译API（推荐）**\n```python\nimport requests\n\ndef translate_with_api(text):\n    \"\"\"使用免费的在线翻译API\"\"\"\n    try:\n        # 方法1: Google翻译API\n        url = f\"http://translate.google.com/translate_a/single?client=gtx&sl=en&tl=zh&dt=t&q={requests.utils.quote(text)}\"\n        response = requests.get(url, timeout=5)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            data = response.json()\n            return data[0][0][0]\n        \n        # 方法2: 备用API\n        url = f\"https://api.mymemory.translated.net/get?q={requests.utils.quote(text)}&langpair=en|zh\"\n        response = requests.get(url, timeout=5)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            data = response.json()\n            return data['responseData']['translatedText']\n            \n        return f\"[翻译] {text}\"\n    except:\n        return f\"[网络错误] {text}\"\n```\n\n### **方案2: 安装轻量级本地翻译引擎**\n```bash\n# 安装Python翻译库\npip install googletrans==4.0.0-rc1\n\n# 或者安装其他翻译库\npip install translate\n```\n\n### **方案3: 使用系统自带翻译（华为手机）**\n如果您的华为手机有HMS Core，可以调用系统翻译服务。\n\n## 🚀 **立即实现方案1：**\n让我修改代码使用在线API：\n\n```python\ndef real_translation(self, text):\n    \"\"\"使用在线翻译API\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import requests\n        # Google翻译API\n        url = f\"http://translate.google.com/translate_a/single?client=gtx&sl=auto&tl=zh&dt=t&q={requests.utils.quote(text)}\"\n        response = requests.get(url, timeout=10)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            data = response.json()\n            return data[0][0][0]\n        return f\"[翻译] {text}\"\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"API翻译错误: {e}\")\n        return f\"[错误] {text}\"\n```\n\n这个方案**不需要额外安装**，使用网络API，速度快且准确！您同意这个方案吗？"}],"api":"openai-comp