{"type":"message","id":"a4f63598","parentId":"ce1dfb93","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:03:56.143Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          太好了！`requests` 库已经成功安装了。现在让我修改手机客户端的翻译函数来使用免费的在线API："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0ebdfb085b6c47ffb7ad1692","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"phone_client.py","oldText":"    def real_translation(self, text):\n        \"\"\"使用translate-shell进行真实翻译\"\"\"\n        try:\n            # 使用translate-shell进行翻译\n            cmd = f\"trans -t zh '{text}'\"\n            result = subprocess.run(cmd, shell=True, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10)\n            \n            if result.returncode == 0:\n                # 提取翻译结果\n                output = result.stdout\n                # 查找翻译结果行\n                lines = output.split('\\n')\n                for line in lines:\n                    if line.strip() and not line.startswith('[') and not '→' in line:\n                        return line.strip()\n                \n                # 如果没找到明确结果，返回原始输出\n                return output[:100]  # 限制长度\n            else:\n                print(f\"翻译命令错误: {result.stderr}\")\n                return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\"\n                \n        except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n            print(\"翻译超时\")\n            return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"翻译错误: {e}\")\n            return f\"[{text}]的翻译结果\"","newText":"    def real_translation(self, text):\n        \"\"\"使用免费的在线翻译API\"\"\"\n        try:\n            import requests\n            \n            # 首选Google翻译API（免费快速）\n            url = f\"https://translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single?client=gtx&sl=auto&tl=zh&dt=t&q={requests.utils.quote(text)}\"\n            response = requests.get(url, timeout=5)\n            \n            if response.status_code == 200:\n                data = response.json()\n                return data[0][0][0]  # 提取翻译结果\n            \n            # 备用方案：MyMemory翻译API\n         