{"type":"message","id":"54fbe236","parentId":"a9932fe1","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:08:08.988Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"            您说得对！翻译API请求可能需要VPN才能访问国外的Google服务。让我为您提供几个解决方案：\n\n## 🎯 **解决方案：**\n\n### **方案1: 使用国内翻译API**\n```python\ndef real_translation(self, text):\n    \"\"\"使用国内可访问的翻译API\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import requests\n        \n        # 方案1: 百度翻译（国内可用）\n        # 需要申请免费API密钥：https://api.fanyi.baidu.com/\n        # 但个人使用有免费额度\n        \n        # 方案2: 有道翻译（国内可用）\n        url = f\"http://fanyi.youdao.com/translate?&doctype=json&type=AUTO&i={requests.utils.quote(text)}\"\n        response = requests.get(url, timeout=5)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            data = response.json()\n            return data['translateResult'][0][0]['tgt']\n        \n        # 方案3: 本地词典备用\n        return self.local_translation(text)\n            \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"翻译错误: {e}\")\n        return self.local_translation(text)\n\ndef local_translation(self, text):\n    \"\"\"本地词典翻译\"\"\"\n    translations = {\n        'hello': '你好', 'hi': '你好', \n        'thank you': '谢谢', 'thanks': '谢谢',\n        'python': 'Python', 'programming': '编程',\n        'world': '世界', 'computer': '电脑',\n        'phone': '手机', 'translation': '翻译'\n    }\n    \n    text_lower = text.lower()\n    if text_lower in translations:\n        return translations[text_lower]\n    \n    # 尝试单词翻译\n    words = text_lower.split()\n    translated = []\n    for word in words:\n        if word in translations:\n            translated.append(translations[word])\n        else:\n            translated.append(word)\n    \n    return ' '.join(translated)\n```\n\n### **方案2: 检查网络连接**\n```bash\n# 测试网络连接\nping -c 3 google.com\nping -c 3 baidu.com\n\n# 检查DNS解析\nnslookup translate.googleapis.com\n```\n\n### **方案3: 使用混合模式**\n先尝试在线API，失败则使用本地词典。\n\n您希望我实现哪个方案？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":73150,"output":497,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73647,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771657637397}}
