{"type":"message","id":"fc82cf61","parentId":"5a01f5a0","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:26:45.988Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到您已经在电脑上安装了 FlClash (D:\\FlClash\\FlClash.exe)。让我帮您找到手机端需要配置的信息。\n\n## 📱 手机端 FlClash 配置信息\n\n### 1. **首先获取电脑端配置信息**\n在电脑上运行 FlClash，然后：\n\n```bash\n# 查看默认配置文件位置\n# 通常在这些位置：\n# C:\\Users\\您的用户名\\.config\\flclash\\config.yaml\n# D:\\FlClash\\config.yaml\n# 程序所在目录的 config 文件夹\n```\n\n### 2. **手机端需要的信息**\n手机配置通常需要：\n\n```yaml\n# 示例配置\nmixed-port: 7890\nallow-lan: true\nmode: rule\nlog-level: info\nexternal-controller: 127.0.0.1:9090\n\nproxies:\n  - name: \"proxy1\"\n    type: ss\n    server: your_server.com\n    port: 443\n    cipher: aes-256-gcm\n    password: \"your_password\"\n    # 更多代理配置...\n\nproxy-groups:\n  - name: \"PROXY\"\n    type: select\n    proxies:\n      - \"proxy1\"\n      - \"proxy2\"\n\nrules:\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,github.com,PROXY\n  - GEOIP,CN,DIRECT\n  - MATCH,PROXY\n```\n\n### 3. **获取具体信息**\n请查看电脑端 FlClash 的：\n1. **端口号** (通常 7890)\n2. **代理服务器信息**\n3. **订阅链接** (如果有)\n4. **认证信息** (如果有)\n\n## 🔧 如果您有订阅链接\n在手机端可以直接使用：\n\n```bash\n# 如果有订阅链接\nwget -O config.yaml \"您的订阅链接\"\n```\n\n您能提供电脑端 FlClash 的配置详情吗？或者有订阅链接吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":75195,"output":432,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75627,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771658777096}}
