{"type":"message","id":"e3d72e91","parentId":"948fc0b1","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:27:55.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到您提供了一个订阅链接。让我帮您在手机上配置 FlClash：\n\n## 📱 **手机端配置步骤**\n\n### 1. **首先安装必要的工具**\n```bash\npkg update\npkg install git python wget\npip install requests pyyaml\n```\n\n### 2. **下载订阅配置**\n```bash\n# 下载配置文件\nwget -O config.yaml \"https://liangxin.xyz/api/v1/liangxin?OwO=76ee7a00dea31c4ddde587c5afd9a88f\"\n\n# 检查配置文件\ncat config.yaml\n```\n\n### 3. **安装 FlClash**\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash.git\ncd FlClash\n```\n\n### 4. **配置和运行**\n```bash\n# 将下载的配置文件移动到FlClash目录\nmv ../config.yaml .\n\n# 运行FlClash\npython flclash.py\n```\n\n### 5. **设置代理**\n```bash\n# 设置环境变量\nexport http_proxy=\"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"\nexport https_proxy=\"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"\n\n# 测试网络\ncurl -x http://127.0.0.1:7890 https://www.google.com\n```\n\n## ⚠️ **注意事项**\n1. 确保订阅链接有效\n2. 检查配置文件格式是否正确\n3. 可能需要调整端口设置\n\n## 🔧 **如果配置失败**\n您也可以直接在 Termux 中运行：\n```bash\n# 直接使用订阅链接\ncurl -x http://127.0.0.1:7890 \"https://translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single?client=gtx&sl=auto&tl=zh&dt=t&q=hello\"\n```\n\n请先尝试下载配置文件，然后告诉我结果！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":75747,"output":407,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76154,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771658846349}}
