{"type":"message","id":"b7d2e1d8","parentId":"a4ab875f","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:29:43.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"您已经在 config.yaml 的编辑界面了。根据您提供的订阅链接，通常需要填写以下信息：\n\n## 📝 **config.yaml 基本配置**\n\n```yaml\n# 基本设置\nmixed-port: 7890        # 代理端口\nallow-lan: true         # 允许局域网连接\nmode: rule              # 规则模式\nlog-level: info         # 日志级别\n\n# 外部控制\nexternal-controller: 127.0.0.1:9090  # 控制端口\n\n# 订阅设置（关键部分）\nproxies:\n  - name: \"proxy-server\"\n    type: ss            # 或其他类型如 vmess、trojan\n    server: \"您的服务器地址\"  # 从订阅获取\n    port: 443           # 服务器端口\n    cipher: \"aes-256-gcm\" # 加密方式\n    password: \"您的密码\"   # 认证密码\n\n# 代理组\nproxy-groups:\n  - name: \"PROXY\"\n    type: select\n    proxies:\n      - \"proxy-server\"\n\n# 规则\nrules:\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,github.com,PROXY\n  - GEOIP,CN,DIRECT\n  - MATCH,PROXY\n```\n\n## 🎯 **您需要的信息**\n\n1. **服务器地址** (server)\n2. **端口号** (port) \n3. **加密方式** (cipher)\n4. **密码** (password)\n5. **代理类型** (type: ss/vmess/trojan等)\n\n## 🔧 **快速配置方法**\n\n如果您有完整的订阅链接，可以尝试：\n\n```bash\n# 退出nano (Ctrl+X)\n# 直接使用订阅链接自动配置\nwget -O config.yaml \"https://liangxin.xyz/api/v1/liangxin?OwO=76ee7a00dea31c4ddde587c5afd9a88f\"\n```\n\n请查看您的订阅详情或告诉我您有哪些服务器信息？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":76247,"output":449,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76696,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771658951315}}
