{"type":"message","id":"e0b2f531","parentId":"9b497989","timestamp":"2026-02-21T07:59:36.417Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          我看到您已经有了一个VPN服务器的详细信息！这是一个 OpenVPN 服务器，让我帮您配置：\n\n## 📱 **手机端 OpenVPN 配置**\n\n### **服务器信息：**\n- **服务器地址**: `vpn613758719.opengw.net`\n- **IP地址**: `222.97.15.183`  \n- **端口**: `443` (TCP)\n- **协议**: OpenVPN\n\n### **在Termux中安装OpenVPN**\n```bash\n# 安装OpenVPN\npkg install openvpn\n\n# 下载OpenVPN配置文件\nwget -O vpn-config.ovpn \"您的OpenVPN配置文件下载链接\"\n\n# 或者手动创建配置文件\ncat > vpn-config.ovpn << EOF\nclient\ndev tun\nproto tcp\nremote vpn613758719.opengw.net 443\nresolv-retry infinite\nnobind\npersist-key\npersist-tun\nauth-user-pass\ncomp-lzo\nverb 3\nEOF\n```\n\n### **运行OpenVPN**\n```bash\n# 启动VPN连接\nopenvpn --config vpn-config.ovpn --auth-user-pass\n\n# 会提示输入用户名和密码\n```\n\n## 🔧 **或者使用更简单的方法**\n\n### **方法1: 使用L2TP/IPsec（如果手机支持）**\n```bash\n# 安装VPN工具\npkg install strongswan\n\n# 配置L2TP\n```\n\n### **方法2: 使用HTTP代理**\n既然已经有了VPN，可以直接设置代理：\n```bash\nexport http_proxy=\"http://222.97.15.183:443\"\nexport https_proxy=\"http://222.97.15.183:443\"\n```\n\n## 🎯 **推荐步骤：**\n1. **获取OpenVPN配置文件**（从您提供的控制面板下载）\n2. **在Termux中安装OpenVPN**\n3. **运行VPN连接**\n\n您有OpenVPN的配置文件(.ovpn文件)吗？或者用户名密码？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":80811,"output":422,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81233,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771660713859}}
