{"type":"message","id":"c1c4251b","parentId":"d601f3b7","timestamp":"2026-02-21T08:16:23.059Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到您提供了 VPNGate 的网站。让我为您提供在手机上设置 VPNGate 的完整指南：\n\n## 📱 **VPNGate 手机设置教程**\n\n### **方法1: 使用 OpenVPN Connect (推荐)**\n1. **在华为应用市场搜索并安装** \"OpenVPN Connect\"\n2. **访问 VPNGate 网站**: https://www.vpngate.net/cn/\n3. **选择服务器**: 点击列表中 ping值最低的服务器\n4. **下载配置文件**: 点击 \"OpenVPN 配置文件下载\"\n5. **导入配置**: 在 OpenVPN App 中导入下载的 .ovpn 文件\n6. **连接**: 输入用户名 `vpn` 密码 `vpn`\n\n### **方法2: 在 Termux 中使用 OpenVPN**\n```bash\n# 安装 OpenVPN\npkg install openvpn\n\n# 下载配置文件（替换为实际下载链接）\nwget -O vpngate.ovpn \"https://www.vpngate.net/do_openvpn.aspx?fq=...&ip=...\"\n\n# 启动 VPN\nopenvpn --config vpngate.ovpn --auth-user-pass\n# 用户名: vpn\n# 密码: vpn\n```\n\n### **方法3: 使用 L2TP/IPsec**\n```bash\n# 安装相关工具\npkg install strongswan\n\n# 配置 L2TP\n# 需要手动配置连接参数\n```\n\n## 🔧 **获取配置文件的具体"}],"timestamp":1771661783032,"stopReason":"stop","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"gateway-injected","idempotencyKey":"62233b15-8301-4620-89ba-36e63308d2a9:assistant","openclawAbort":{"aborted":true,"origin":"rpc","runId":"62233b15-8301-4620-89ba-36e63308d2a9"}}}
